                                Packed with powerful antioxidants that promote heart health, reduce oxidative stress, and support cholesterol levels.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="discover-item-tags">
                        <div class="discover-item__tag">Antioxidant boost</div>
                        <div class="discover-item__tag">Heart health</div>
